  "limitations": [
    "Physical coverage is S22 Android14 and Windows11 x64. Camera1 fallback is covered by production-class Java tests, not a physical older device.",
    "Native zoom can combine optics and digital sensor crop; no claim that every ratio is optical. Android decides automatic physical-lens routing.",
    "Only advertised camera IDs were explicitly selected. Active physical IDs are readback metadata, not private IDs probed by the test.",
    "Brightness uses real automatic-exposure EV compensation, disabled in manual mode. The backend does not invent an independent Android brightness control.",
    "Manual shutter and ISO and white-balance presets are shown only when reported by the camera. No subjective color calibration or every-device guarantee is claimed.",
    "The actual Windows receiver and production viewer were mounted in a diagnostic entrypoint. Widget tests verify control order and slider/dropdown gestures; real network actions were invoked through its private local diagnostic API."
  ],
